# Task 144-018: Orphan Cleanup (.tasks + locks) + Pre-flight

## Approach

### 1. New Module: src/core/orphan-cleaner.ts

Two main functions:

#### `postFinalizeCleanup(projectRoot, sprintId)`
- Scans `.tasks/` for task files matching current sprint
- DONE/NO_GO tasks → move to `.tasks/archive/sprint-<N>/`
- PENDING/EXECUTING tasks → preserve (skip)
- `.locks/` stale detection (>5min) → remove stale locks
- Uses existing `clearStaleLocks` from file-lock.ts

#### `preflightOrphanCleanup(projectRoot, currentSprintId)`
- Called BEFORE PLAN phase in sprint-controller.ts
- Scans `.tasks/` for task files NOT belonging to currentSprintId
- Checks `.deckent/pids/` — if another live sprint pid exists, SKIP
- Moves orphan task files to `.tasks/archive/sprint-<N>/`
- Returns cleanup report

### 2. Wire into sprint-finalizer.ts
- Replace or supplement step 12b with `postFinalizeCleanup()`
- Called after archiveOrphanTasks

### 3. Wire into sprint-controller.ts
- Call `preflightOrphanCleanup()` before PLAN phase in `runSprint()`

### 4. Tests
- tests/core/orphan-cleaner.test.ts: 4 post-finalize + 4 pre-flight tests
- tests/orchestra/preflight-cleanup.test.ts: 4 integration tests

## Files Changed
- NEW: src/core/orphan-cleaner.ts
- MODIFY: src/orchestra/sprint-finalizer.ts (import + call postFinalizeCleanup)
- MODIFY: src/orchestra/sprint-controller.ts (import + call preflightOrphanCleanup)
- NEW: tests/core/orphan-cleaner.test.ts
- NEW: tests/orchestra/preflight-cleanup.test.ts
